        <briefdescription>
<para>Updates all active enemy entities. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This method iterates over all entities with <ref refid="structTransform" kindref="compound">Transform</ref>, Enemy, Patrol, and PhysicsBody components. For each active enemy, it:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Moves the enemy horizontally according to its patrol path.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Applies gravity to the enemy&apos;s vertical velocity.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Checks and resolves collisions with platforms.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Clamps the enemy to the world floor.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Updates the grounded state.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>registry</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Reference to the ECS registry containing all entities. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>deltaTime</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para><ref refid="classTime" kindref="compound">Time</ref> elapsed since the last frame (seconds). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>platforms</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>List of entity IDs that act as collision platforms. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>worldMinY</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The minimum Y coordinate of the world (floor level). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
