        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Performs AABB collision detection between the player and an enemy. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This method checks if the player&apos;s bounding box overlaps with an enemy&apos;s bounding box using the Axis-Aligned Bounding Box (AABB) algorithm.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>playerPos</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The player&apos;s world position. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>playerSize</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The player&apos;s scale (width and height). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>enemyPos</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The enemy&apos;s world position. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>enemySize</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The enemy&apos;s scale (width and height). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>true if the player and enemy are overlapping, false otherwise. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
