    <briefdescription>
<para>System that updates enemy entities with patrol, physics, and collision. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classEnemySystem" kindref="compound">EnemySystem</ref> processes all entities that have the Enemy, Patrol, and PhysicsBody components. It handles:</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Horizontal patrol movement between two points</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Gravity and vertical velocity</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Collision detection and resolution with platforms</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Grounded state detection</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>World boundary clamping</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This system is designed to be called once per frame from the scene&apos;s <ref refid="classEnemySystem_1a122dd4911d2670f242ec120e6a82081e" kindref="member">Update()</ref>. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="structComponents_1_1Enemy" kindref="compound">Components::Enemy</ref>, <ref refid="structComponents_1_1Patrol" kindref="compound">Components::Patrol</ref>, <ref refid="structComponents_1_1PhysicsBody" kindref="compound">Components::PhysicsBody</ref>, <ref refid="structComponents_1_1Transform" kindref="compound">Components::Transform</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
